Recommends: qt6-wayland
Description: Educational Python IDE for kids (NEO One / STEM & Robotics)
 NEO Code is an open-source Python IDE designed for STEM and Robotics
 students aged 6-12, built for the NEO One education device
 (ARM64/Armbian) and standard Linux desktops.
 .
 Kids write and run Python with a child-friendly editor and a REPL. The
 UI is a PyQt6 + QML front end; PyQt6 and the Qt6 QML runtime (QtQuick,
 QtQuick.Controls) are pulled from apt, never built via pip.
